OL,3,GNEWSAZimmer frame thrown at train
OL,4,Aattacker, jury hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers were "chucking everything"
OL,7,Fincluding a toaster and a woman's
OL,8,FZimmer frame at a man who was stabbing
OL,9,Fpeople on a busy train, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FAnthony Williams stabbed 10 people on
OL,13,Fthe train which made an unscheduled
OL,14,Fstop in Huntingdon, Cambridgeshire, on
OL,15,F1 November last year.
OL,17,FOne of the victims, Raza Aslam, told
OL,18,FCambridge Crown Court he was handed a
OL,19,Ffrying pan to defend himself as "all
OL,20,Fhell's broken loose".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
